            "detailed_description": "A hack and slash action adventure, set in a fantasy pixel art environment. Play solo or co-op in this adventure from bottom to top of Castle Hammerwatch. Kill hordes of enemies with varied looks and features through four unique environments with traps, hidden secrets and puzzles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 different classes, with unique features and skills<br></li><li>Character development through unlocks and upgrades<br></li><li>Hard, medium and easy of course<br></li><li>Customize difficulty with several different modifiers<br></li><li>Controller support, supports various different gamepads<br></li><li>Multiplayer COOP, for up to four players, online, LAN and local<br></li><li>PC, MAC and Linux support<br></li><li>Mod and editing support, make your own levels and change other things to your liking</li></ul>",
